theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 31
text = "EPISODE I
A NEW CURRICULUM

It is a period of intergalactic confusion. Having raided Earth, curious extraterrestrials have become obsessed with human culture, snacks, and questionable television broadcasts.

Their researchers cloned one human specimen. Fresh subjects now tumble down a cold metal chute into an alien academy on the Moon. Earth hangs above the horizon. You are the academy's latest transfer student.

The syllabus is simple: attend class, or be vaporized. Eat to survive. Spend your allowance. Build a starship, one suspicious purchase at a time.

And whatever you do…

DO NOT DISTURB THE TEACHER."
horizontal_alignment = 1
autowrap_mode = 3

